[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0085","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0085.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0101","title":"Make-a-Store OrderPage购物车应用程序敏感信息修改漏洞","description":"Make-a-Store OrderPage 购物车应用程序存在设计缺陷，远程攻击者可通过修改网页中隐藏表单字段（hidden form fields）来篡改订单中的敏感购买信息，如商品价格、数量等。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，攻击方式简单，可导致未授权修改订单数据，影响购物车应用的数据完整性与安全性。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0101"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-02-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:00Z","remediation":"立即停止使用隐藏表单域存储价格等敏感交易数据，改为在服务端会话中维护购物车金额与商品信息。对 Make-a-Store OrderPage 所有表单提交进行服务端价格校验，并在 Web 服务器配置中禁用客户端提交价格/数量等关键字段的覆盖能力。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0101","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0101.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3d8ee18720c8a74c03524a9994e81b2de7f6b0ec/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0101.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0101","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/edba2e8a11daaad31ff57bea0f9419186eb54326/2000/CVE-2000-0101.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0101.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4dd512046a74ddd9ae16741caf0933056ffd666e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0101.json","https://github.com/feststelltaste/software-analytics/blob/e0a9cb3397bfdc5537f1d13415fb6ffdca1ce6d9/prototypes/CVE%20Analysis.ipynb","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_300_400.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-472.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0085.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0085.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0094","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0094.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0110","title":"WebSiteTool购物车应用程序隐藏表单域信息修改漏洞","description":"WebSiteTool 购物车应用程序存在信息修改漏洞，远程攻击者可通过篡改网页中隐藏表单字段（hidden form fields）的值来修改敏感购买信息（如商品价格、数量、订单金额等），导致非授权篡改交易数据。该漏洞源于应用程序在服务端未对客户端提交的隐藏字段值进行校验，完全信任了浏览器端传入的数据。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0110"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-02-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"对 WebSiteTool 购物车应用，必须将所有价格、数量等敏感字段在服务端进行校验，禁止信任客户端提交的隐藏表单字段值。建议将会话状态（如购物车内容）存储在服务端 Session 中，而非以隐藏字段形式发回客户端。由于该产品已停止维护，强烈建议迁移至仍在安全更新周期内的购物车平台（如 Magento、WooCommerce 等），并对所有传入参数实施白名单校验。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0110","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2000-0110"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0094.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0094.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0308","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0308.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0109","title":"Standard & Poors ComStock MultiCSP 默认口令远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Standard & Poor's ComStock 4.2.4 的 MultiCSP 系统存在默认口令漏洞，系统中预置了多个无密码或使用弱口令的账户，远程攻击者可通过这些默认凭证登录系统，进而执行任意命令，完全控制目标主机。该漏洞影响 ComStock 4.2.4 版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0109"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:01Z","remediation":"立即删除或禁用 MultiCSP 系统中所有默认账户（如不具有密码或密码过于简单的账户），强制为每个账户设置强密码（至少 12 位含大小写字母、数字和特殊字符）。如业务允许，建议升级至 ComStock 最新版本或更换为受支持的替代产品。同时限制 mcsp 服务的网络访问范围，仅允许受信任 IP 连接，并在防火墙层面过滤 8080 等相关端口作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0109","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19823","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2000/CVE-2000-0109.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/47aadecb5d7f9b0723652503f764f5addc1275b9/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0109.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0109","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/edba2e8a11daaad31ff57bea0f9419186eb54326/2000/CVE-2000-0109.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/ffa50060b7ba6ae58d60d6d90533e77eaf10d466/2000/CVE-2000-0109/README.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0109.md","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/multicsp_detect.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bbc8c0a71659f005292a66be54d5a75a1b892d59/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-7mr6-q53m-r42p/GHSA-7mr6-q53m-r42p.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0109.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0308.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0308.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0308.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0119","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0119.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0132","title":"Microsoft Java Virtual Machine getSystemResourceAsStream 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Microsoft Java Virtual Machine（JVM）的 getSystemResourceAsStream 方法存在信息泄露漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的请求，利用该函数读取服务器上的任意文件内容，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Virtual Machine 2000 系列及 3000 系列版本，攻击者无需认证即可利用，危害等级较低但可配合其他漏洞提升威胁。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0132"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:04Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 针对此漏洞发布的安全更新（对应公告 MS00-011），该补丁限制了 getSystemResourceAsStream 的权限。长期缓解措施是卸载 Microsoft Java Virtual Machine（通过\"添加/删除程序\"或在注册表中禁用），改用 Oracle Java 或其他受支持的 Java 运行时环境，因为 MS JVM 已停止维护且存在多个已知安全缺陷。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/957","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19734","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fbe4faa82ea56a60f688d9bd92ecf2ac8f256a8a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0132.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0132","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0132.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5c6904371163d9b81521151d4181001adee1b956/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0132.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/27c4f121935f3d39975151db62fdb766905681f3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4r25-8qgq-j8pv/GHSA-4r25-8qgq-j8pv.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0132.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/957/info.html","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idinfor"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0119.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0119.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0119.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0102","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0102.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0117","title":"Cobalt RaQ siteUserMod.cgi 特权提升漏洞","description":"Cobalt RaQ2 服务器中的 siteUserMod.cgi 程序存在权限管理缺陷，允许站点管理员在未授权的情况下修改其他用户、站点管理员乃至超级管理员（root）的密码。攻击者只需拥有站点管理员权限即可利用此漏洞，通过直接调用 CGI 接口实现权限提升，获取服务器的完全控制权限。该漏洞影响 Cobalt RaQ2 系列服务器，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0117"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-30T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:02Z","remediation":"限制 siteUserMod.cgi 访问权限：移除该 CGI 可执行权限（chmod 000 siteUserMod.cgi）或直接删除文件。在 Apache 配置中对 /cgi-bin/ 目录添加 IP 白名单（Allow from 可信管理网段），仅限堡垒机/管理 IP 访问。由于 Cobalt 已被 Sun 收购且 RaQ 系列早已停产，建议迁移至仍在维护的 Linux 发行版或现代服务器管理面板，从根本上消除该漏洞风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/951","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40188c20a9aa81abfbfb911b27fe583dd73cd29e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0117.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0117","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0117.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/97b4cb3f61e03100104d7050d5d2fad3d3489e66/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0117.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/34be50da481c4de09d71edba37b06626b315858e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-w7xc-wpq5-5vgr/GHSA-w7xc-wpq5-5vgr.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/web-cgi.rules","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/S/siteUserMod.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0117.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001124.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--385e86d7-3341-4386-868d-471d16d57fe8.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0102.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0102.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0101","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0101.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0116","title":"Check Point Firewall-1 脚本标签检查绕过漏洞","description":"Check Point Software Firewall-1 3.0 存在脚本标签过滤绕过漏洞。由于防火墙未能正确过滤 SCRIPT 标签，远程攻击者可通过在 SCRIPT 标签前额外添加一个 `<` 字符来绕过系统的\"Strip Script Tags\"（剥离脚本标签）安全限制，导致恶意脚本内容得以通过防火墙过滤。该漏洞影响 Check Point Firewall-1 3.0 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高危，攻击者无需身份认证即可实施攻击。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0116"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-29T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:02Z","remediation":"升级 Check Point Firewall-1 至 4.0 及以上版本，该版本已修复 Script Tag 检查绕过漏洞。如无法升级，可在应用层规则中启用 HTTP 协议检测并添加脚本标签过滤规则，严格限制 script 标签的嵌套与转义形式。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/1212","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/954","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19732","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40188c20a9aa81abfbfb911b27fe583dd73cd29e/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0116.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0116","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0116.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/97b4cb3f61e03100104d7050d5d2fad3d3489e66/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0116.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/3f70e6a601722304a9bfb028d474ddc908ac9d9b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vhf9-r8ff-33pc/GHSA-vhf9-r8ff-33pc.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_500_600.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0116.json","https://github.com/Team-Atlanta/aixcc-asc-atlantis/blob/785c446f980e12155935db586aa30c3b54adcc86/crs/src/crs-patch/smith/smith/lib/cwe/raw/CWE-167.txt","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001123.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--29222771-9a98-489f-8f34-1fde553f4c76.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0101.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0101.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0101.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0095","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0095.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0111","title":"RightFax Web客户端会话劫持漏洞","description":"RightFax Web客户端存在可预见会话编号漏洞，远程攻击者可通过预测或枚举会话编号直接劫持其他用户的已认证会话，无需获取用户凭证即可访问系统。该漏洞影响RightFax Web客户端，CVSS评分7.5，危害等级高危。建议升级至修复版本或实施会话随机化机制。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0111"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-29T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:01Z","remediation":"升级 RightFax 至厂商已修复该问题的版本（如 RightFax 9.4 或更高版本），启用 Web 客户端安全会话模式，在服务器配置中将会话 ID 生成算法改为随机数而非顺序递增。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器前端部署反向代理并配置会话劫持防护规则，同时启用 HTTPS 加密传输防止会话 ID 被嗅探。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/953","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV