 目录的写入权限，仅允许 root 用户访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www-1.ibm.com/support/docview.wss?uid=isg1IY07832","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/433499","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7929","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2000/CVE-2000-1216.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b160e6f2915ac726b29ee0689fc920f5016abef5/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1216.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/84cdd54c70c68603acd478a90957e5c6d8e65c65/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1216.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1216","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1216.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1216.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1216.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2000/CVE-2000-1216.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-12xx/CVE-2000-1216.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/ec763d1afde14e5e0e8f602252273d336e97634c/2000/CVE-2000-1216.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1151.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0117","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0117.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0130","title":"SCO scohelp 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"SCO UnixWare 系统中的 scohelp 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标系统发送特制请求触发该漏洞，导致攻击者能够在受影响系统上以 root 权限执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 SCO UnixWare 多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。建议用户及时升级至厂商修复版本以消除风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0130"],"sources":["avd"],"publish