e5942b9b8e11c25937ecfba21c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0097.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/136f8e11918ce66b2191bce34c9fdd746a45739c/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-726j-722q-69g3/GHSA-726j-722q-69g3.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2008/remote-MS00-006.nasl","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/ms_index_server.nasl","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0097.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0081.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0080","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0080.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0096","title":"Qualcomm qpopper 3.0 LIST 命令远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Qualcomm qpopper 3.0 beta 版本 POP3 守护进程在处理 LIST 命令时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。已通过身份认证的攻击者可通过向 TCP 端口 110 上的 POP3 服务发送超长特制的 LIST 命令参数，触发栈缓冲区溢出，导致攻击者能够以 qpopper 进程权限执行任意代码，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞 CVSS v2 评分 7.2，危害等级高，影响系统机密性、完整性和可用性。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0096"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-26T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:59Z","remediation":"升级至 qpopper 3.0 正式发布版（非 beta 版本）以修复 LIST 命令缓冲区溢出漏洞。由于 Qualcomm 已停止维护 qpopper，建议迁移至 Dovecot 等活跃维护的 POP3/IMAP 服务器。临时缓解措施包括限制本地用户对 qpopper 服务的访问权限，并通过系统审计日志监控异常的 LIST 命令请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/948","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19729","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/72f387512fbbb3f0e46713b23cdbd1f9c533d1f7/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0096.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0096","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0096.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d67487551d3c04e5942b9b8e11c25937ecfba21c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0096.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/0e291808cb617ccf4c842a91d82530cb507f8570/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rp69-5w75-5xrq/GHSA-rp69-5w75-5xrq.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/q/qpopper_list.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--67381bb6-5e61-4ed8-ada4-af1bc2e74f2e.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001116.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0080.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0114","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0114.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0126","title":"Microsoft IIS 3.0/4.0 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 3.0/4.0 及 Index Server 2.0 中的示例 Internet Data Query (IDQ) 脚本存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送包含 `..`（点点）序列的特制 HTTP 请求，绕过路径限制读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响运行 Microsoft IIS 3.0/4.0 及 Index Server 2.0 的 Windows 系统，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。Microsoft 已在安全公告 MS00-006 中发布修复补丁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0126"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-01-26T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-006 提供的补丁（Index Server 2.0 Intel 版下载地址见公告），或升级至 Windows 2000 及以上版本。如无法升级，可删除 IIS 中示例 IDQ 脚本文件（默认位于 /scripts/samples 目录），并禁用 .idq/.ida ISAPI 映射扩展。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-2000-0126","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19742","https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-006","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2000-0126"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0114.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0079","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0079.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0095","title":"HP HP-UX Path MTU Discovery 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"HP-UX 10.30 及 11.00 操作系统的路径 MTU 发现（PMTU discovery）机制存在设计缺陷，当接收到特定的小型数据包时，系统会生成大量响应流量，导致网络带宽被过度消耗。远程攻击者可利用该漏洞将目标主机作为流量放大反射器，实施分布式拒绝服务（DDoS）攻击，影响网络可用性。该漏洞无需认证即可利用，攻击门槛较低，对受影响系统所在网络环境构成严重威胁。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0095"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-01-24T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:59Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 HP 针对此漏洞发布的安全补丁（HP Security Bulletin HPSBUX0001-114），或升级至已修复的 HP-UX 11.0 后续版本。如无法打补丁，可执行 ndd -set /dev/ip ip_send_source_quench 0 禁用源端抑制，并在边界防火墙上限制外部发往 HP-UX 主机的 ICMP 不可达消息速率，从源头阻断放大攻击流量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/944","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/advisory.html?id=2041","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/72f387512fbbb3f0e46713b23cdbd1f9c533d1f7/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0095.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0095","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7f1c35ad28226319c149c937b6a2e7a1986924ce/content/CVE-2000-0095.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d67487551d3c04e5942b9b8e11c25937ecfba21c/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0095.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/0e291808cb617ccf4c842a91d82530cb507f8570/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x4q4-xrjj-86w6/GHSA-x4q4-xrjj-86w6.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/1c14ae4816efb67123e0664d061a6cbfe48f234b/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0095.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152100_152200.json","https://github.com/dong-xs/Vul-PAG/blob/7eb3b32094a5270cfd8495366e0e4a7df5a874ce/aspect_prediction/org_pred_diff.txt","https://github.com/RiskBasedPrioritization/RiskBasedPrioritizationAnalysis/blob/3d5cc1819ecb8cbc3aeb75d9a8260318544faf56/data_in/acme/acme_cves.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0079.toml"}]